{"id":40,"slug":"40-web-components-gom-nhung-cong-nghe-nao","category":"HTML","subcategory":"HTML5","level":"advanced","question_vi":"Web Components gồm những công nghệ nào?","question_en":"What technologies make up Web Components?","answer_vi":"Web Components là ba API dùng chung để tạo element **tái sử dụng, không phụ thuộc framework**:\n\n**1. Custom Elements** — đăng ký thẻ riêng.\n**2. Shadow DOM** — cô lập DOM và CSS bên trong.\n**3. HTML Template** — `<template>` và `<slot>` để khai báo cấu trúc.\n\n```html\n<template id=\"card-tpl\">\n  <style> .box { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 12px; } </style>\n  <div class=\"box\"><slot></slot></div>\n</template>\n\n<script>\nclass MyCard extends HTMLElement {\n  connectedCallback() {\n    const tpl = document.getElementById('card-tpl')\n    this.attachShadow({ mode: 'open' })\n        .append(tpl.content.cloneNode(true))\n  }\n}\ncustomElements.define('my-card', MyCard)   // tên BẮT BUỘC có dấu gạch ngang\n</script>\n\n<my-card>Nội dung được chiếu vào slot</my-card>\n```\n\nLợi ích thật sự: style bên trong **không rò ra ngoài và bên ngoài không lọt vào**, nên hợp với design system dùng chung giữa React/Vue/Angular, hoặc widget nhúng vào trang của khách.\n\n**Lưu ý:** Shadow DOM chặn luôn CSS của bạn — muốn cho phép tuỳ biến phải chủ động mở qua CSS custom properties hoặc `::part()`","answer_en":"Web Components are three APIs used together to build **reusable, framework-independent** elements:\n\n**1. Custom Elements** — register your own tag.\n**2. Shadow DOM** — isolate the internal DOM and CSS.\n**3. HTML Templates** — `<template>` and `<slot>` to declare the structure.\n\n```html\n<template id=\"card-tpl\">\n  <style> .box { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 12px; } </style>\n  <div class=\"box\"><slot></slot></div>\n</template>\n\n<script>\nclass MyCard extends HTMLElement {\n  connectedCallback() {\n    const tpl = document.getElementById('card-tpl')\n    this.attachShadow({ mode: 'open' })\n        .append(tpl.content.cloneNode(true))\n  }\n}\ncustomElements.define('my-card', MyCard)   // the name MUST contain a hyphen\n</script>\n\n<my-card>Content projected into the slot</my-card>\n```\n\nThe real value: internal styles **neither leak out nor let outside styles in**, which suits a design system shared across React/Vue/Angular, or a widget embedded on a customer's page.\n\n**Note:** Shadow DOM blocks your own CSS too — to allow theming you must deliberately open holes with CSS custom properties or `::part()`","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Web Components là ba API dùng chung để tạo element <strong>tái sử dụng, không phụ thuộc framework</strong>:</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>1. Custom Elements</strong> — đăng ký thẻ riêng.<br/><strong>2. Shadow DOM</strong> — cô lập DOM và CSS bên trong.<br/><strong>3. HTML Template</strong> — <code>&lt;template&gt;</code> và <code>&lt;slot&gt;</code> để khai báo cấu trúc.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;template id=&quot;card-tpl&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;style&gt; .box { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 12px; } &lt;/style&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;box&quot;&gt;&lt;slot&gt;&lt;/slot&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/template&gt;\n\n&lt;script&gt;\nclass MyCard extends HTMLElement {\n  connectedCallback() {\n    const tpl = document.getElementById('card-tpl')\n    this.attachShadow({ mode: 'open' })\n        .append(tpl.content.cloneNode(true))\n  }\n}\ncustomElements.define('my-card', MyCard)   // tên BẮT BUỘC có dấu gạch ngang\n&lt;/script&gt;\n\n&lt;my-card&gt;Nội dung được chiếu vào slot&lt;/my-card&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;card-tpl&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">style</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.box</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">border</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">1px</span> solid <span class=\"hljs-number\">#ddd</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">padding</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">12px</span>; } </span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">style</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;box&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">slot</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">slot</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"language-javascript\">\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">MyCard</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">extends</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_ inherited__\">HTMLElement</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">connectedCallback</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> tpl = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;card-tpl&#x27;</span>)\n    <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">attachShadow</span>({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">mode</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;open&#x27;</span> })\n        .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">append</span>(tpl.<span class=\"hljs-property\">content</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">cloneNode</span>(<span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>))\n  }\n}\ncustomElements.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">define</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;my-card&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">MyCard</span>)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// tên BẮT BUỘC có dấu gạch ngang</span>\n</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">my-card</span>&gt;</span>Nội dung được chiếu vào slot<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">my-card</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Lợi ích thật sự: style bên trong <strong>không rò ra ngoài và bên ngoài không lọt vào</strong>, nên hợp với design system dùng chung giữa React/Vue/Angular, hoặc widget nhúng vào trang của khách.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> Shadow DOM chặn luôn CSS của bạn — muốn cho phép tuỳ biến phải chủ động mở qua CSS custom properties hoặc <code>::part()</code>.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Web Components are three APIs used together to build <strong>reusable, framework-independent</strong> elements:</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>1. Custom Elements</strong> — register your own tag.<br/><strong>2. Shadow DOM</strong> — isolate the internal DOM and CSS.<br/><strong>3. HTML Templates</strong> — <code>&lt;template&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;slot&gt;</code> to declare the structure.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;template id=&quot;card-tpl&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;style&gt; .box { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 12px; } &lt;/style&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;box&quot;&gt;&lt;slot&gt;&lt;/slot&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/template&gt;\n\n&lt;script&gt;\nclass MyCard extends HTMLElement {\n  connectedCallback() {\n    const tpl = document.getElementById('card-tpl')\n    this.attachShadow({ mode: 'open' })\n        .append(tpl.content.cloneNode(true))\n  }\n}\ncustomElements.define('my-card', MyCard)   // the name MUST contain a hyphen\n&lt;/script&gt;\n\n&lt;my-card&gt;Content projected into the slot&lt;/my-card&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;card-tpl&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">style</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.box</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">border</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">1px</span> solid <span class=\"hljs-number\">#ddd</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">padding</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">12px</span>; } </span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">style</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;box&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">slot</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">slot</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"language-javascript\">\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">MyCard</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">extends</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_ inherited__\">HTMLElement</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">connectedCallback</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> tpl = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;card-tpl&#x27;</span>)\n    <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">attachShadow</span>({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">mode</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;open&#x27;</span> })\n        .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">append</span>(tpl.<span class=\"hljs-property\">content</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">cloneNode</span>(<span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>))\n  }\n}\ncustomElements.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">define</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;my-card&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">MyCard</span>)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// the name MUST contain a hyphen</span>\n</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">my-card</span>&gt;</span>Content projected into the slot<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">my-card</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">The real value: internal styles <strong>neither leak out nor let outside styles in</strong>, which suits a design system shared across React/Vue/Angular, or a widget embedded on a customer's page.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Note:</strong> Shadow DOM blocks your own CSS too — to allow theming you must deliberately open holes with CSS custom properties or <code>::part()</code>.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — Web Components","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_components"},{"label":"MDN — Using shadow DOM","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_components/Using_shadow_DOM"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/26-html5-co-nhung-tinh-nang-moi-nao-so-voi-html4","title":"HTML5 có những tính năng mới nào so với HTML4?"},{"url":"/q/27-canvas-va-svg-khac-nhau-the-nao","title":"Canvas và SVG khác nhau thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/31-progressive-web-app-pwa-la-gi","title":"Progressive Web App (PWA) là gì?"},{"url":"/q/34-history-api-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"History API dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/35-websocket-khac-http-the-nao","title":"WebSocket khác HTTP thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/36-intersection-observer-api-la-gi","title":"Intersection Observer API là gì?"},{"url":"/q/3-the-doctype-la-gi-tai-sao-can-khai-bao-doctype","title":"Thẻ DOCTYPE là gì? Tại sao cần khai báo DOCTYPE?"},{"url":"/q/4-cau-truc-co-ban-cua-mot-tai-lieu-html-bao-gom-nhung-gi","title":"Cấu trúc cơ bản của một tài liệu HTML bao gồm những gì?"}]}